## Summary
`@family/ui` says it exports 7 primitives. Only `Card` exists in the repo, and neither app imports it. Both apps rebuild a card by hand with the same Tailwind classes. The player app also builds a pill-shaped primary button inline. The main finding is that the card surface has been duplicated across apps, and most of the documented UI kit can't be found.

