## Explicit foundation
- **`docs/DESIGN.md`:** says shared tokens and primitives are authoritative. Cards use a 12px radius and primary actions are pill-shaped. Workflow-specific tables should stay local.
- **`packages/ui/README.md`:** lists exports Button, Card, Alert, TextField, Modal, Tabs and DataTable, with tokens in `src/tokens.css`.
- **What actually exists:** only `packages/ui/src/components/Card.tsx`, which renders `<section className="ui-card">`. There's no `tokens.css`, no CSS defining `.ui-card`, no barrel/index export, no `package.json`, no Tailwind config, and no lint or drift checks.
- **Docs vs. code mismatch:** 6 of the 7 listed components and the token file are missing. They might live somewhere outside this checkout or might never have been written; I can't tell from here.

## Implicit inventory

| Pattern | Repeated contract | Sources | Relation to shared kit | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Surface card | `<section className="rounded-xl border bg-white p-5">` + `<h2>` title | `apps/player/Home.tsx` (×2: "My team", "Top players"), `apps/admin/Users.tsx` (×1: "Operators") | A twin of `Card` (`ui-card`). `rounded-xl` is 12px in default Tailwind, which matches DESIGN.md | **Confirmed**: identical markup, 3 times, in 2 apps |
