|---|---|---|---|
| **Panel** (surface) | `.panel`: 1px `#ddd` border, 12px radius, 24px padding, white background. Always a `<div>` wrapping an `h2` heading. | `styles.css:1`; `billing.tsx:1` ("Payment method"); `team.tsx:1` ("Members") | **Confirmed.** Used twice, identically |
